    <string name="arena_note_ludo">Ludo has four seats: Computer A plays the 1st and 3rd, Computer B the 2nd and 4th. A win counts for the side whose token gets home first.</string>
    <string name="arena_note_yahtzee">Yahtzee is a score race: each computer fills its own scorecard and the higher total wins.</string>
    <string name="arena_note_stalls">If a game makes no progress for 20 seconds the watchdog ends it as stalled and the series carries on. A stalled game points at a bug in that game, not at the computers.</string>

